{"effective_mode":"compact","effective_text_preview_length":200,"nodes":[{"end_index":7,"heading_level":1,"paragraph_id":"61C75E76","paragraph_index":1,"start_index":0,"text_preview":"一：工作大背景","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":9,"paragraph_id":"3321DACF","paragraph_index":2,"start_index":8,"text_preview":"{","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":92,"paragraph_id":"34D3F9BD","paragraph_index":3,"start_index":10,"text_preview":"人力资源公司Second Talent 通过招聘、借调（secondment）与名义雇主（EOR, Employer of Record）三种方式，为客户输送人才。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":155,"paragraph_id":"43208686","paragraph_index":4,"start_index":93,"text_preview":"需要搭建一套HRIS人力资源信息系统，其中有一个功能是AI智能匹配候选人：客户描述一个岗位，系统就能推荐最合适的候选人档案。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":229,"paragraph_id":"51D5ABBA","paragraph_index":5,"start_index":156,"text_preview":"由于公司有70%~80%的岗位是技术类（AI, front-end前端, back-end后端, full-stack全栈），因此该项目聚焦技术岗","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":277,"paragraph_id":"0D29F1BD","paragraph_index":6,"start_index":230,"text_preview":"当前面临的问题：招聘顾问靠人工一份份比对简历与客户需求，非常耗时；而AI可以加快筛选名单的速度","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":278,"paragraph_id":"1D2B9A1B","paragraph_index":7,"start_index":278,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":451,"paragraph_id":"2CC3CB5C","paragraph_index":8,"start_index":279,"text_preview":"最终目标：给系统一份职位描述(JD)，系统返回一份排好序的简历入围名单，每一份都附带一句简短的推荐理由——（“且这份名单要让Second Talent公司的","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":452,"paragraph_id":"6E5D622F","paragraph_index":9,"start_index":452,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":458,"paragraph_id":"0F8C9625","paragraph_index":10,"start_index":453,"text_preview":"主要任务：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":570,"paragraph_id":"1F68C0AA","paragraph_index":11,"start_index":459,"text_preview":"1：准备数据——收集匿名化的技术岗JD(职位描述)与简历，外加约50组经过招聘顾问认可的“优质匹配”配对组（也就是参考范例，即招聘顾问团队通过","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":571,"paragraph_id":"10B40E94","paragraph_index":12,"start_index":571,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":621,"paragraph_id":"66A00EEB","paragraph_index":13,"start_index":572,"text_preview":"2：写匹配指南——说明从简历和JD里分别要提取什么作为判断信息，以及对应的每个因素又分别占多少分量","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":622,"paragraph_id":"25692E55","paragraph_index":14,"start_index":622,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":678,"paragraph_id":"4F232801","paragraph_index":15,"start_index":623,"text_preview":"3：搭建一个基线模型baseline——一个简单的匹配器加一套测试，说明它有多大概率选对人（达成“优质匹配”）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":679,"paragraph_id":"12C27FE3","paragraph_index":16,"start_index":679,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":680,"paragraph_id":"4AB0F2EB","paragraph_index":17,"start_index":680,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":691,"paragraph_id":"0163F7D8","paragraph_index":18,"start_index":681,"text_preview":"简历匹配的具体流程：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":711,"paragraph_id":"7327BE1B","paragraph_index":19,"start_index":692,"text_preview":"1：读取JD，把岗位要求整理成一份清单","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":734,"paragraph_id":"56B50B31","paragraph_index":20,"start_index":712,"text_preview":"2：读取简历：把这个人身上的对应信息提取出来","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":787,"paragraph_id":"7A7B4611","paragraph_index":21,"start_index":735,"text_preview":"3：过滤：剔除明显不合格的（如地点，notice period通知期，语言等与JD要求不符合的简历）简历","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":833,"paragraph_id":"663BF043","paragraph_index":22,"start_index":788,"text_preview":"4：打分：各因素按照权重加总，合成一个分数score，代表“这个人在多大程度上匹配该项目）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":852,"paragraph_id":"247D1E5F","paragraph_index":23,"start_index":834,"text_preview":"5：排序：给出前5名，并逐个写明理由","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":935,"paragraph_id":"5DA99C1F","paragraph_index":24,"start_index":853,"text_preview":"推荐的AI工作方式：先用一个 AI 模型去读那些格式杂乱的简历 PDF，把内容填进一张固定格式的表；再用一个机器学习模型，从已标注的配对里学出「什","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":956,"paragraph_id":"4ED72C26","paragraph_index":25,"start_index":936,"text_preview":"招聘顾问最看重什么（哪些要素权重应该高）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1009,"paragraph_id":"2FC5944F","paragraph_index":26,"start_index":957,"text_preview":"0硬性筛选（不符合的角色将被强制筛掉）：地点、时区、是否可远程、通知期（离职提前多久）、 英语及其他语言","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1039,"paragraph_id":"49D760C2","paragraph_index":27,"start_index":1010,"text_preview":"1最高：硬技能重合度(必备项 vs 加分项)、相关经验年限","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1083,"paragraph_id":"66A7C5F2","paragraph_index":28,"start_index":1040,"text_preview":"2高：资历层级(初级 / 中级 / 高级 / 负责人)、角色期望薪资与岗位预算是否匹配","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1131,"paragraph_id":"097FDFF3","paragraph_index":29,"start_index":1084,"text_preview":"3中：行业 / 领域背景、任职稳定性（每段在职时长、空窗期）、学历或证书（仅当岗位确实需要时）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1138,"paragraph_id":"09BF3177","paragraph_index":30,"start_index":1132,"text_preview":"数据与工具：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1223,"paragraph_id":"06D960F3","paragraph_index":31,"start_index":1139,"text_preview":"Manatal（我们用的 ATS，即申请人跟踪系统）是简历（PDF）和 JD 的主要来源；此外我们也从 LinkedIn Recruiter 和Juicebox 取材。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1302,"paragraph_id":"5C68FF07","paragraph_index":32,"start_index":1224,"text_preview":"起始表格「Manatal Examples – JD & CV (anonymised)」里有 50 份 JD 和 100 份简历，目前还没有任何匹配标签。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1347,"paragraph_id":"430C8496","paragraph_index":33,"start_index":1303,"text_preview":"目标量：100–200 份技术岗 JD，以及约 50 组「优质匹配」的简历–JD 配对。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1427,"paragraph_id":"71726D89","paragraph_index":34,"start_index":1348,"text_preview":"工具：Claude 负责信息抽取与脱敏（masking）；Python、pandas、embedding（嵌入向量）与 Google Sheets 负责标注。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1432,"paragraph_id":"4DE10E17","paragraph_index":35,"start_index":1428,"text_preview":"隐私规定","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1530,"paragraph_id":"1A68E8CE","paragraph_index":36,"start_index":1433,"text_preview":"隐私规定：任何数据离开 Second Talent 之前，必须先把姓名、邮箱、电话、地址、照片和 LinkedIn 链接全部脱敏；并且要人工复核一遍。在 Eric 批准之前，","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1532,"paragraph_id":"45B7DF42","paragraph_index":37,"start_index":1531,"text_preview":"}","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1557,"paragraph_id":"465795B2","paragraph_index":38,"start_index":1533,"text_preview":"以上内容为我们老师发的项目以及要求方案的相关内容","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1558,"paragraph_id":"206E5AE5","paragraph_index":39,"start_index":1558,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1559,"paragraph_id":"0E9E251E","paragraph_index":40,"start_index":1559,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1574,"heading_level":1,"paragraph_id":"575BC7DA","paragraph_index":41,"start_index":1560,"text_preview":"二：当前手头上已有数据集解说","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":1575,"paragraph_id":"3B1A420E","paragraph_index":42,"start_index":1575,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1674,"paragraph_id":"0E6A8036","paragraph_index":43,"start_index":1576,"text_preview":"当前手头上已有的数据集（即老师在blackboard里上传，允许学生下载的内容，位于文件目录STAT6207_group7_finalproject\\dataset_from_blackboard","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1675,"paragraph_id":"26C5562F","paragraph_index":44,"start_index":1675,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1755,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"7B88163F","paragraph_index":45,"start_index":1676,"text_preview":"A：表格Manatal Examples- JD & CV（anonymised）：分别含有两个Sheet：JD Examples和 CV Examples；","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":1874,"paragraph_id":"2ECA7289","paragraph_index":46,"start_index":1756,"text_preview":"其中，JD Examples代表50个“职位描述”，即职位名称Position，以及对应的要求和描述（如role family、country、是否remote、contract type等，以及Job description职位","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1964,"paragraph_id":"2798D128","paragraph_index":47,"start_index":1875,"text_preview":"CV Examples代表100份整理后的简历，即简历名称/编号（Ref），以及对应的简历信息标签（如Current title、current company、skills等）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2001,"paragraph_id":"2C9CA7C6","paragraph_index":48,"start_index":1965,"text_preview":"这50 份 JD 和 100 份简历，目前并没有任何匹配标签与匹配关系!","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2002,"paragraph_id":"10DE44A8","paragraph_index":49,"start_index":2002,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2040,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"539AB4C5","paragraph_index":50,"start_index":2003,"text_preview":"B：验证集数据JD-and-Hired-CV-(30)-examples：","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2232,"paragraph_id":"39FC8E5D","paragraph_index":51,"start_index":2041,"text_preview":"每一份pdf都代表一份职位描述，和一份对应的被录取者简历，是一个经公司人工业务确认的“优质匹配，标准模范录用”。{如P11的首页描述了关于Human R","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2269,"paragraph_id":"2FEAB162","paragraph_index":52,"start_index":2233,"text_preview":"此为基准测试集数据，绝对不能在模型训练阶段进入训练，而是应当被用于验证。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2270,"paragraph_id":"66317820","paragraph_index":53,"start_index":2270,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2271,"paragraph_id":"5C858C98","paragraph_index":54,"start_index":2271,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2284,"heading_level":1,"paragraph_id":"75EBEE47","paragraph_index":55,"start_index":2272,"text_preview":"三：任务目标与实现方式：","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2294,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"6E94613D","paragraph_index":56,"start_index":2285,"text_preview":"阶段一：数据的准备","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2383,"paragraph_id":"4D635167","paragraph_index":57,"start_index":2295,"text_preview":"鉴于当前缺乏“JD和CV的优质配对”情况，我认为应当直接利用外接LLM模型“deepseek-V4.1-Flash”，对数据集进行“AI打标下的优质配对”从而人造数据用于","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2498,"paragraph_id":"7636BA26","paragraph_index":58,"start_index":2384,"text_preview":"AI打标的对象为表格Manatal Examples- JD & CV（anonymised）——请为该表格里的50份JD，各自为其找一份所对应的CV，从而实现50组JD-CV配对。不要使用任何偷懒技","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2618,"paragraph_id":"5F8E652C","paragraph_index":59,"start_index":2499,"text_preview":"我知道这可能会导致遍历情况下的成本激增（50条jd x 100份CV），但是deepseek v4.1足够便宜，我能支付起这个成本。而且整个表格也就180多kb，能有多少数","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2619,"paragraph_id":"28C52B8B","paragraph_index":60,"start_index":2619,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2706,"paragraph_id":"01032B77","paragraph_index":61,"start_index":2620,"text_preview":"已经完成了，配对总表位于dataset_from_blackboard\\llm_labelled_pairs下，里面记载了JD1-JD50每一份JD所对应的“优质匹配CV”","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2757,"paragraph_id":"51F2F7D2","paragraph_index":62,"start_index":2707,"text_preview":"在制造好“50份 JD和CV的 优质匹配 ”后，我们当前手中就有了匹配关系。后续的工作也会更加顺利。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2758,"paragraph_id":"0FE9777E","paragraph_index":63,"start_index":2758,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2769,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"62FD9AF4","paragraph_index":64,"start_index":2759,"text_preview":"阶段二：匹配指南设计","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":2779,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"41759397","paragraph_index":65,"start_index":2770,"text_preview":"JD 侧标签与作用","type":"Heading"},{"col_count":3,"end_index":3500,"first_row_texts":["","",""],"paragraph_index":66,"row_count":17,"start_index":2780,"table_end":3500,"table_id":"55kv56kg","table_index":0,"table_start":2780,"type":"Table"},{"end_index":3501,"paragraph_id":"6A39F947","paragraph_index":67,"start_index":3501,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3511,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"3CDDA773","paragraph_index":68,"start_index":3502,"text_preview":"CV 侧标签与作用","type":"Heading"},{"col_count":3,"end_index":4106,"first_row_texts":["","",""],"paragraph_index":69,"row_count":16,"start_index":3512,"table_end":4106,"table_id":"00he2myg","table_index":1,"table_start":3512,"type":"Table"},{"end_index":4107,"paragraph_id":"6CBFC990","paragraph_index":70,"start_index":4107,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4138,"paragraph_id":"499445C2","paragraph_index":71,"start_index":4108,"text_preview":"附注：由于“远程办公remote”的存在，因此制定如下规则：","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4185,"paragraph_id":"46A9FFFA","paragraph_index":72,"start_index":4139,"text_preview":"若 jd.remote_allowed == true   → 地点这条跳过（不淘汰任何人）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4234,"paragraph_id":"02CDE580","paragraph_index":73,"start_index":4186,"text_preview":"若 jd.remote_allowed == false 或 unknown → 国家不同则淘汰","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4319,"paragraph_id":"648AE69B","paragraph_index":74,"start_index":4235,"text_preview":"也就是，如果允许远程办公，那么跳过地点（country和city）；反之如果没有明确说明允许remote，则不得不老老实实进入地点判定——国家不同/city不同则","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4320,"paragraph_id":"7C4E70E5","paragraph_index":75,"start_index":4320,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":4347,"paragraph_id":"055B000D","paragraph_index":76,"start_index":4321,"text_preview":"阶段三：基于本地LLM的信息提取与标签整理翻译程序。","type":"Paragraph"}],"pagination":{"has_more":false,"limit":0,"offset":0,"returned_nodes":76,"total_nodes":76},"stats":{"total_headings":9,"total_numbering_lists":0,"total_paragraphs":65,"total_tables":2},"version":0}
